unds in agro-industrial production chains, credit rights investment funds, bank credit notes, and debentures. In addition, the company offers multi-product platform across foreign exchange, interest rates, commodities, and fixed income markets; derivative products comprising futures, swaps, forwards, and options; foreign exchange consisting of spot transactions and forward settlements; asset and liability management; fixed income, which include funding products, as well as trading in the secondary market for government bonds, debentures, and securitizations; and bank guarantees. Further, it manages the wealth of high-net-worth families; and makes minority investments in small and medium-sized companies through privately negotiated deals and structure vehicles. The company was formerly known as BR Advisory Partners Participa\u00e7\u00f5es S.A. The company was founded in 2009 and is headquartered in S\u00e3o Paulo, Brazil."}}